    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even enduring is just more of the same. more noise, more blood, more feeling like i'm just a ghost watching a tragedy play out on repeat. i'm just so incredibly done with the noise. i just want everything to be quiet. i want to find a way to just stop feeling it all.",
